# Netlify SPA routing with correct HTTP status codes.
#
# Known SPA routes → serve index.html with HTTP 200.
# All other paths → serve index.html with HTTP 404 so the client renders the
# noindex 404 page and crawlers receive a correct status without fetching a
# separate document.
#
# Keep this list in sync with the <Switch> routes in src/App.tsx.
# Run `node scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs --env=production` when routes change.

